      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"454\">🕊 Bad Eden POLITICAL DRIFT SYSTEM — CANON CODEX</h1><blockquote data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"528\"><p data-start=\"458\" data-end=\"528\">“Your faction is not what it says.<br data-start=\"492\" data-end=\"495\">It is what it repeatedly does.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"533\"><h1 data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"566\">📘 1. WHAT POLITICAL DRIFT IS</h1><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"1076\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"613\"><tr data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"613\"><th data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"575\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Term</th><th data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"594\" data-col-size=\"md\">Canon Definition</th><th data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"613\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mal Translation</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"1076\"><tr data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"772\"><td data-start=\"659\" data-end=\"682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Political Philosophy</td><td data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"745\" data-col-size=\"md\">Actor identity flag (<code data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"743\">flags.bbttcc-aae.politicalPhilosophy</code>)</td><td data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"772\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“Your declared belief.”</td></tr><tr data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"883\"><td data-start=\"773\" data-end=\"781\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Drift</td><td data-start=\"781\" data-end=\"856\" data-col-size=\"md\">Mechanical pressure applied when faction behavior contradicts philosophy</td><td data-start=\"856\" data-end=\"883\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“Your hypocrisy meter.”</td></tr><tr data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"986\"><td data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"904\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minority Pressure</td><td data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"964\" data-col-size=\"md\">Extra drift if roster ideology distribution is imbalanced</td><td data-start=\"964\" data-end=\"986\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“Dissent is math.”</td></tr><tr data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1076\"><td data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1003\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Severity Band</td><td data-start=\"1003\" data-end=\"1041\" data-col-size=\"md\">Stability state of faction identity</td><td data-start=\"1041\" data-end=\"1076\" data-col-size=\"sm\">“How close you are to rupture.”</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1081\"><h1 data-start=\"1083\" data-end=\"1114\">🧠 2. HOW DRIFT IS CALCULATED</h1><p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1151\">Drift is determined by aggregating:</p><ol data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1298\"><li data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1190\"><p data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1190\"><strong data-start=\"1156\" data-end=\"1190\">Roster philosophy distribution</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1216\"><p data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1216\"><strong data-start=\"1194\" data-end=\"1216\">Campaign beat tags</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1217\" data-end=\"1237\"><p data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1237\"><strong data-start=\"1220\" data-end=\"1237\">Raid outcomes</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1262\"><p data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1262\"><strong data-start=\"1241\" data-end=\"1262\">Darkness behavior</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1298\"><p data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1298\"><strong data-start=\"1266\" data-end=\"1298\">Minority suppression actions</strong></p></li></ol><p data-start=\"1300\" data-end=\"1319\">This is not random.</p><p data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1350\">It is deterministic pressure.</p><hr data-start=\"1352\" data-end=\"1355\"><h2 data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1382\">📊 DRIFT INPUT SOURCES</h2><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1980\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1422\"><tr data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1422\"><th data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1393\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Source</th><th data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1403\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Example</th><th data-start=\"1403\" data-end=\"1422\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Drift Direction</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1980\"><tr data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1552\"><td data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1484\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Violence-heavy raids</td><td data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1523\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Repeated Assault + Qliphothic Gambit</td><td data-start=\"1523\" data-end=\"1552\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Push toward Authoritarian</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1645\"><td data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1585\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Peace Accords + Charity Drive</td><td data-start=\"1585\" data-end=\"1615\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Diplomacy + Faith behaviors</td><td data-start=\"1615\" data-end=\"1645\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Push toward Liberal/Social</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1732\"><td data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1668\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Industrial Sabotage</td><td data-start=\"1668\" data-end=\"1695\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Coercive economy control</td><td data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1732\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Push toward Authoritarian/Statist</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1815\"><td data-start=\"1733\" data-end=\"1759\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Apocalyptic Weapon Test</td><td data-start=\"1759\" data-end=\"1784\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Destructive escalation</td><td data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1815\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Push toward Fascist/Corrupt</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1912\"><td data-start=\"1816\" data-end=\"1847\" data-col-size=\"sm\">High Darkness + Dark Harvest</td><td data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1875\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Entropy-driven extraction</td><td data-start=\"1875\" data-end=\"1912\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Push toward Authoritarian/Corrupt</td></tr><tr data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1980\"><td data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1935\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Ritual purification</td><td data-start=\"1935\" data-end=\"1960\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Light-aligned behavior</td><td data-start=\"1960\" data-end=\"1980\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stabilizes drift</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr data-start=\"1982\" data-end=\"1985\"><h1 data-start=\"1987\" data-end=\"2028\">📈 3. DRIFT SEVERITY BANDS (LIVE MODEL)</h1><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2483\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2090\"><tr data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2090\"><th data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2044\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Drift Score</th><th data-start=\"2044\" data-end=\"2051\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Band</th><th data-start=\"2051\" data-end=\"2070\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mechanical State</th><th data-start=\"2070\" data-end=\"2090\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Narrative Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2483\"><tr data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2203\"><td data-start=\"2153\" data-end=\"2159\" data-col-size=\"sm\">0–2</td><td data-start=\"2159\" data-end=\"2168\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Stable</td><td data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2181\" data-col-size=\"sm\">No penalty</td><td data-start=\"2181\" data-end=\"2203\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Philosophy aligned</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2266\"><td data-start=\"2204\" data-end=\"2210\" data-col-size=\"sm\">3–5</td><td data-start=\"2210\" data-end=\"2221\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Strained</td><td data-start=\"2221\" data-end=\"2246\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minor internal dissent</td><td data-start=\"2246\" data-end=\"2266\" data-col-size=\"sm\">GM warning beats</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2345\"><td data-start=\"2267\" data-end=\"2273\" data-col-size=\"sm\">6–8</td><td data-start=\"2273\" data-end=\"2285\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Fractured</td><td data-start=\"2285\" data-end=\"2312\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Minority pressure active</td><td data-start=\"2312\" data-end=\"2345\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Mechanical penalties possible</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2412\"><td data-start=\"2346\" data-end=\"2353\" data-col-size=\"sm\">9–11</td><td data-start=\"2353\" data-end=\"2365\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Rupturing</td><td data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2388\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Drift events trigger</td><td data-start=\"2388\" data-end=\"2412\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Forced choice moment</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2483\"><td data-start=\"2413\" data-end=\"2419\" data-col-size=\"sm\">12+</td><td data-start=\"2419\" data-end=\"2430\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Collapse</td><td data-start=\"2430\" data-end=\"2463\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Schism / capture / reformation</td><td data-start=\"2463\" data-end=\"2483\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Identity rewrite</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2552\">⚠ Drift is not automatic faction loss.<br data-start=\"2523\" data-end=\"2526\">It forces <em data-start=\"2536\" data-end=\"2552\">choice events.</em></p><hr data-start=\"2554\" data-end=\"2557\"><h1 data-start=\"2559\" data-end=\"2584\">🧩 4. MINORITY PRESSURE</h1><p data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2660\">Live design: minorityPressure logic avoids hair-trigger for small rosters.</p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2857\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2684\"><tr data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2684\"><th data-start=\"2662\" data-end=\"2674\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Condition</th><th data-start=\"2674\" data-end=\"2684\" data-col-size=\"md\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2857\"><tr data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2746\"><td data-start=\"2709\" data-end=\"2729\" data-col-size=\"sm\">1 dissenter in 10</td><td data-start=\"2729\" data-end=\"2746\" data-col-size=\"md\">Minor warning</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2778\"><td data-start=\"2747\" data-end=\"2762\" data-col-size=\"sm\">30% minority</td><td data-start=\"2762\" data-end=\"2778\" data-col-size=\"md\">Drift kicker</td></tr><tr data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2857\"><td data-start=\"2779\" data-end=\"2800\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suppression action</td><td data-start=\"2800\" data-end=\"2857\" data-col-size=\"md\">Extra drift for libertarian or anarchist philosophies</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"2859\" data-end=\"2889\">Minority pressure scales with:</p><ul data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2945\"><li data-start=\"2891\" data-end=\"2904\"><p data-start=\"2893\" data-end=\"2904\">Roster size</p></li><li data-start=\"2905\" data-end=\"2922\"><p data-start=\"2907\" data-end=\"2922\">Action severity</p></li><li data-start=\"2923\" data-end=\"2945\"><p data-start=\"2925\" data-end=\"2945\">Repeated suppression</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2967\"><strong data-start=\"2947\" data-end=\"2967\">Mal Translation:</strong></p><blockquote data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3036\"><p data-start=\"2971\" data-end=\"3036\">“Silencing one voice is quiet.<br data-start=\"3001\" data-end=\"3004\">Silencing many is arithmetic.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"3038\" data-end=\"3041\"><h1 data-start=\"3043\" data-end=\"3079\">⚖ 5. PHILOSOPHY CONSEQUENCE MATRIX</h1><p data-start=\"3081\" data-end=\"3131\">(Abbreviated — live canon includes 8 philosophies)</p><hr data-start=\"3133\" data-end=\"3136\"><h2 data-start=\"3138\" data-end=\"3167\">🔴 Authoritarian / Statist</h2><p data-start=\"3169\" data-end=\"3299\">| Violent success | Drift − |<br>| Peace Accords | Drift + |<br>| Minority dissent | Drift − if suppressed |<br>| High Unity | Stabilizes |</p><blockquote data-start=\"3301\" data-end=\"3321\"><p data-start=\"3303\" data-end=\"3321\">“Order above all.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"3323\" data-end=\"3326\"><h2 data-start=\"3328\" data-end=\"3341\">🔵 Liberal</h2><p data-start=\"3343\" data-end=\"3471\">| Excess violence | Drift + |<br>| Charity &amp; Justice | Drift − |<br>| Apocalyptic weapon | Major drift + |<br>| High Darkness | Drift + |</p><blockquote data-start=\"3473\" data-end=\"3496\"><p data-start=\"3475\" data-end=\"3496\">“Rights before rule.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"3498\" data-end=\"3501\"><h2 data-start=\"3503\" data-end=\"3526\">🟢 Social Democratic</h2><p data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3646\">| Charity + Ration | Drift − |<br>| Industrial sabotage | Drift + |<br>| Peace Accords | Drift − |<br>| Suppression | Drift + |</p><blockquote data-start=\"3648\" data-end=\"3670\"><p data-start=\"3650\" data-end=\"3670\">“Collective uplift.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"3672\" data-end=\"3675\"><h2 data-start=\"3677\" data-end=\"3694\">🟣 Libertarian</h2><p data-start=\"3696\" data-end=\"3830\">| Suppression | Major Drift + |<br>| Peaceful trade | Drift − |<br>| Heavy regulation actions | Drift + |<br>| Violence-heavy raids | Drift + |</p><blockquote data-start=\"3832\" data-end=\"3860\"><p data-start=\"3834\" data-end=\"3860\">“Freedom above stability.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"3862\" data-end=\"3865\"><h2 data-start=\"3867\" data-end=\"3879\">⚫ Fascist</h2><p data-start=\"3881\" data-end=\"4015\">| Violence success | Drift − |<br>| Peace accords | Drift + |<br>| High Unity | Stabilizes |<br>| High Darkness | Drift − (dangerous synergy) |</p><blockquote data-start=\"4017\" data-end=\"4044\"><p data-start=\"4019\" data-end=\"4044\">“Strength defines truth.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"4046\" data-end=\"4049\"><h2 data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4067\">🟡 Theocratic</h2><p data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4193\">| Ritual purification | Drift − |<br>| Dark Harvest | Drift + |<br>| Apocalyptic violence | Drift + |<br>| Crown of Mercy | Drift − |</p><blockquote data-start=\"4195\" data-end=\"4223\"><p data-start=\"4197\" data-end=\"4223\">“Faith must remain clean.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"4225\" data-end=\"4228\"><h2 data-start=\"4230\" data-end=\"4255\">🟤 Marxist / Communist</h2><p data-start=\"4257\" data-end=\"4385\">| Resource Expropriation | Drift − |<br>| Private hoarding | Drift + |<br>| Peace Accords | Drift − |<br>| Apocalyptic weapon | Drift + |</p><blockquote data-start=\"4387\" data-end=\"4414\"><p data-start=\"4389\" data-end=\"4414\">“Equity above dominance.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"4416\" data-end=\"4419\"><h2 data-start=\"4421\" data-end=\"4435\">⚪ Anarchist</h2><p data-start=\"4437\" data-end=\"4557\">| Forced order | Drift + |<br>| Decentralized alignment | Drift − |<br>| Siege occupation | Drift + |<br>| Liberation | Drift − |</p><blockquote data-start=\"4559\" data-end=\"4583\"><p data-start=\"4561\" data-end=\"4583\">“No one owns the sky.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"4585\" data-end=\"4588\"><h1 data-start=\"4590\" data-end=\"4634\">🧨 6. DRIFT EVENTS (WHEN BAND ≥ RUPTURING)</h1><p data-start=\"4636\" data-end=\"4662\">At Rupturing band, one of:</p><div class=\"TyagGW_tableContainer\"><div tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit\"><table data-start=\"4664\" data-end=\"4860\" class=\"w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)\"><thead data-start=\"4664\" data-end=\"4682\"><tr data-start=\"4664\" data-end=\"4682\"><th data-start=\"4664\" data-end=\"4672\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Event</th><th data-start=\"4672\" data-end=\"4682\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Effect</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4860\"><tr data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4733\"><td data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4712\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Reform</td><td data-start=\"4712\" data-end=\"4733\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Adjust philosophy</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4787\"><td data-start=\"4734\" data-end=\"4748\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Enforcement</td><td data-start=\"4748\" data-end=\"4787\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Suppress minority (raises Darkness)</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4814\"><td data-start=\"4788\" data-end=\"4797\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Schism</td><td data-start=\"4797\" data-end=\"4814\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Split faction</td></tr><tr data-start=\"4815\" data-end=\"4860\"><td data-start=\"4815\" data-end=\"4826\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Collapse</td><td data-start=\"4826\" data-end=\"4860\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Lose control of hex / captured</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-start=\"4862\" data-end=\"4905\">These are GM-governed but system-triggered.</p><hr data-start=\"4907\" data-end=\"4910\"><h1 data-start=\"4912\" data-end=\"4948\">🌑 7. DRIFT + DARKNESS INTERACTION</h1><p data-start=\"4950\" data-end=\"4986\">Darkness accelerates drift severity.</p><p data-start=\"4988\" data-end=\"5124\">| Darkness ≥ 10 | Drift gains amplified |<br>| Darkness ≥ 15 | Drift events escalate faster |<br>| Ritual corruption | Immediate drift spike |</p><p data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5146\"><strong data-start=\"5126\" data-end=\"5146\">Mal Translation:</strong></p><blockquote data-start=\"5148\" data-end=\"5182\"><p data-start=\"5150\" data-end=\"5182\">“Shadow makes you choose badly.”</p></blockquote><hr data-start=\"5184\" data-end=\"5187\"><h1 data-start=\"5189\" data-end=\"5219\">🔄 8. DRIFT RESET CONDITIONS</h1><p data-start=\"5221\" data-end=\"5245\">Drift can be reduced by:</p><ul data-start=\"5247\" data-end=\"5372\"><li data-start=\"5247\" data-end=\"5276\"><p data-start=\"5249\" data-end=\"5276\">Consistent aligned behavior</p></li><li data-start=\"5277\" data-end=\"5301\"><p data-start=\"5279\" data-end=\"5301\">Strategic Unity boosts</p></li><li data-start=\"5302\" data-end=\"5320\"><p data-start=\"5304\" data-end=\"5320\">Justice Tribunal</p></li><li data-start=\"5321\" data-end=\"5342\"><p data-start=\"5323\" data-end=\"5342\">Ritual purification</p></li><li data-start=\"5343\" data-end=\"5372\"><p data-start=\"5345\" data-end=\"5372\">Successful narrative reform</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5374\" data-end=\"5425\">It cannot be erased instantly without consequences.</p><hr data-start=\"5427\" data-end=\"5430\"><h1 data-start=\"5432\" data-end=\"5461\">📜 PLAYER EDUCATION SUMMARY</h1><p data-start=\"5463\" data-end=\"5487\">Political Drift ensures:</p><ul data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5665\"><li data-start=\"5489\" data-end=\"5521\"><p data-start=\"5491\" data-end=\"5521\">Violence has ideological cost.</p></li><li data-start=\"5522\" data-end=\"5558\"><p data-start=\"5524\" data-end=\"5558\">Mercy has ideological consequence.</p></li><li data-start=\"5559\" data-end=\"5595\"><p data-start=\"5561\" data-end=\"5595\">Suppression affects faction unity.</p></li><li data-start=\"5596\" data-end=\"5634\"><p data-start=\"5598\" data-end=\"5634\">Darkness shapes long-term alignment.</p></li><li data-start=\"5635\" data-end=\"5665\"><p data-start=\"5637\" data-end=\"5665\">You cannot min-max morality.</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"5667\" data-end=\"5670\"><h1 data-start=\"5672\" data-end=\"5688\">🗣 MAL SUMMARY</h1><blockquote data-start=\"5690\" data-end=\"5787\"><p data-start=\"5692\" data-end=\"5787\">“You may win every raid.<br data-start=\"5716\" data-end=\"5719\">But if your philosophy fractures,<br data-start=\"5754\" data-end=\"5757\">you will lose your faction.”</p></blockquote>"
      },
